incare for throwing me into the deep end with this challenge and supporting the whole build. The Anytime Daily SPF 50 Moisturiser. was a lifesaver out on the road, and the Original Shower Gel was purely for the safety of everyone around me at the finish line.\n\nMad day out. Massive respect to every single person taking on these events.\n\nBig love, girls and boys 🫡 \n\n#BulldogSkincare #IRONMANLeeds #IRONMANEurope #ad","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_54de714fa467412112a94fb7c929","publishedAt":"2026-09-02T17:26:13.000Z","profileId":"prf_8feeaf45a91ad7e0ceb7e2958f8d","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DcywWY3KkSS/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":2585637,"likesCount":3,"sharesCount":319,"commentsCount":41,"interactionsCount":363,"engagementRatePerViews":0.014039093654677745,"engagementRatePerFollowers":0.030534607991992025,"profileFollowersCount":1188815,"profileFollowingCount":903,"profilePostsCount":542,"mediaCount":1,"duration":93.18,"hashtags":["#bulldogskincare","#ironmanleeds","#ironmaneurope","#ad"],"coAuthors":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"bulldogskincare"}],"mentions":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"bulldogskincare"}]}]},"metadata":{"pagination":{"offset":0,"limit":3,"totalCount":874},"requestId":"req_iuzefqf2vdHWc12ZTYDmthbEP3iH","executionTime":257,"timestamp":1790494188218}}}